> > > >
> > > > X <- mni152@.Data
> > > > L <- nifti(X[rev(seq_len(nrow(X))), rev(seq_len(ncol(X))), ])
> > > > R <- aperm(X, c(2, 3, 1))
> > > > L <- aperm(L, c(2, 3, 1))
> > > >
> > > > The differences for L and R are because I wanted the anterior part of the brain to be facing left and right, respectively.
